  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Advance Democracy and Stability in Moldova</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project will establish and manage a flexible, quick-response mechanism supporting activities that will advance democracy and stability in Moldova. The activity will work with a coalition of civic, media, and government stakeholders in support of program goals. The program will operate primarily through a small grants mechanism and will rely on ongoing analysis of the local context to inform programming.</narrative>
  </description>
